1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:00,440
Hello.

2
00:00:01,020 --> 00:00:02,480
My name is Richard Armstrong.

3
00:00:03,140 --> 00:00:06,440
You may recall that I picked up a few books at your store this afternoon.

4
00:00:06,440 --> 00:00:09,315
I need to report a slight problem with one.

5
00:00:10,100 --> 00:00:15,060
When I opened the plastic wrapper to read the book, I noticed that several pages in it were torn.

6
00:00:15,820 --> 00:00:21,660
Since it cost me $25, I'd really like to have my money refunded or receive a brand-new copy.

7
00:00:22,460 --> 00:00:29,140
I'll be visiting the store again tomorrow with the book, but I thought that I ought to call ahead of time so that you'll be expecting me.

8
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:29,835
Thanks a lot.

9
00:00:30,240 --> 00:00:30,520
Goodbye.
